  "description": "*Frames shipping now!\n\nDoppo ‘High Plains Drifter’\n\nA mountain flyer/klunker style bike for the modern age. The Doppo 'High Plains Drifter' is a refreshing return to the foundations of mountain bikes- with some modern features to keep you smiling out on the open plains.\n\nThe ‘High Plains Drifter’ is handcrafted in small batch production here in Portland, Oregon. This latest offering is a modern twist on a time-tested favorite, sure to bring back some pleasant reminders of some of your earliest memories on a bike, while opening up a world of possibility for future off-road explorations.\n\nOwing some distinct styling queues from early mountain bikes and those iconic 'Klunker' bikes of the early 70's Marin County lore- 'High Plains Drifter' will turn heads out in the world and remind you of how fun it can be to ride a rigid MTB.",
